# Mobile App Configuration

# Backend API URL
# For local development: Replace YOUR_LOCAL_IP with your computer's IP address
# For production: Use your deployed backend URL
API_URL=http://YOUR_LOCAL_IP:5001/api

# How to find your local IP:
# - Windows: Open Command Prompt and type 'ipconfig' (look for IPv4 Address)
# - Mac/Linux: Open Terminal and type 'ifconfig' or 'ip addr'
# - Must be on the same WiFi network as your testing device

# Examples:
# Local development: http://192.168.0.162:5001/api
# Production: https://roomeo-backend.herokuapp.com/api

